   "type": "equation",
   "content": "\\frac{\\beta^\\alpha}{\\Gamma(\\alpha)} \\int_0^{+\\infty} x^{\\alpha-1} e^{-x(\\beta-t)} dx \\stackrel{x(\\beta-t)=y}{=} \\frac{\\beta^\\alpha}{\\Gamma(\\alpha)} \\int_0^\\infty y^{\\alpha-1} e^{-y} dy \\cdot \\frac{1}{(\\beta-t)^\\alpha}"
